    <description><![CDATA[My team got rank 5th at finals.
<h1 id="pwn">Pwn</h1>
<h2 id="1-pwn-baik">1. PWN Baik</h2>
<h3 id="deskripsi">Deskripsi</h3>
<div class="details admonition info">
        <div class="details-summary admonition-title">
            <i class="icon fas fa-info-circle fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>Click to show the desc<i class="details-icon fas fa-angle-right fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="details-content">
            <div class="admonition-content"><p>Baik Banget Cuma Input Input (Kayaknya)</p>
<p>nc 195.154.94.231 50151</p>
</div>
